    "name": "LocoNav Integration Alert Subscriptions Vehicles API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "LocoNav's REST APIs for fleet telematics integration: telematics (sensor/GPS/video/live-stream), CRUD resource management (drivers, vehicles, trips, geofences, users), safety and connected-driver features, alerts and alert-subscriptions, and immobilization. Converted from LocoNav's published Postman documentation at developers.loconav.com. All listing endpoints are paginated (page/perPage); time parameters use epoch seconds.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: LocoNav Developer Support",
      "type": "text/plain"
    }
  }
